,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement this method to mark a point annotation with a view object. If you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"want to mark a particular point annotation with a static image instead, omit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this method or have it return ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" for that annotation, then implement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:imageForAnnotation:"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Annotation views are compatible with UIKit, Core Animation, and other Cocoa","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Touch frameworks. On the other hand, static annotation images use less memory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and draw more quickly than annotation views.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user location annotation view can also be customized via this method. When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"annotation"},{"text":" is an instance of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation","type":"reference"},{"text":" (or equal to the map view’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userLocation"},{"text":" property), return an instance of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(or a subclass thereof).","type":"text"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Related examples","type":"heading","anchor":"Related-examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images, learn how to specify what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier